====== GL.iNet GL-MT3000 ======

The GL.iNet GL-MT3000 or Beryl AX is a travel router that was released in 2023. It has two Ethernet ports (2.5 Gbps WAN and 1 Gbps LAN), two 802.11ax/Wi-Fi 6 radios (2.4GHz/5GHz), one USB 3.0 Type-A port, one USB-C port for power, and a toggle switch customizable through the OEM web UI. GL.iNet ships the device with a customized version of OpenWrt that uses their own web UI by default.

{{:media:gl.inet:gl-mt3000_back.jpg?300|GL-MT3000 rear view}}

