==== OEM web UI Installation ====

The GL-MT3000 ships on a fork of Openwrt with a custom web UI. You can upgrade to official Openwrt from the GL.iNet web UI by flashing a sysupgrade image as follows.

=== GL.iNet web UI ===

  * Browse to ''<nowiki>http://192.168.8.1/#/upgrade</nowiki>'' GL.iNet Web Upgrade URL
  * Upload image file for sysupgrade
  * Do **not** keep the configuration, making the router reset.

=== Luci ===

  * Browse to ''<nowiki>http://192.168.8.1/cgi-bin/luci</nowiki>''  There is also a link in the GL.iNet web UI under Advanced Settings
  * Go to System/Backup-Flash Firmware
  * Select Flash new firmware image at the bottom
  * Upload image file for sysupgrade
  * Do **not** keep the configuration, making the router reset.

